			"notes": "# What's New?\n\n- The configuration system has been refactored: instead of a single JSON file, you now have a folder where you can place multiple JSON files. Each file’s name will become the namespace for the items it defines. Accordingly, the `id` field of your items should now contain only the item name, without a namespace.  \n- Added support for the `always_edible` field for food items, allowing them to be eaten even when the player’s hunger bar is full."
